    "Archived tabs are forgotten. History keeps the pages you visited." : {
      "comment" : "Message of the sheet that asks before clearing the Archive page.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Archivierte Tabs werden vergessen. Der Verlauf behält die besuchten Seiten."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Las pestañas archivadas se olvidan. El historial conserva las páginas que visitaste."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Les onglets archivés seront oubliés. L’historique conserve les pages que vous avez consultées."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "I pannelli archiviati vengono dimenticati. La cronologia conserva le pagine visitate."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "アーカイブしたタブは削除されます。閲覧したページは履歴に残ります。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "보관된 탭은 삭제됩니다. 방문한 페이지는 방문 기록에 남습니다."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Gearchiveerde tabbladen worden vergeten. De geschiedenis bewaart de pagina’s die je hebt bezocht."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Zarchiwizowane karty zostaną zapomniane. Historia zachowuje odwiedzone strony."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "As abas arquivadas são esquecidas. O histórico mantém as páginas que você visitou."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Архивированные вкладки будут забыты. История сохранит посещённые вами страницы."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Arşivlenen sekmeler unutulur. Geçmiş, ziyaret ettiğiniz sayfaları saklar."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "已归档的标签页会被忘掉。历史记录仍会保留你访问过的页面。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "封存的分頁將會刪除，但你造訪過的網頁仍會保留在瀏覽記錄中。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Archived tabs show up here when Settings › Tabs › Archive tabs you haven’t used is on." : {
      "comment" : "On the Archive page while archiving is off. Name the setting as it reads in Settings › Tabs.",
      "localizations" : {
