    "Pin Group" : {
      "comment" : "A command in the command bar, named as in the menu bar.\nItem in a tab's context menu in the sidebar. The tab is in a group of tabs; the whole group pins as a folder.\nMenu bar item: pins the whole group of tabs the tab is in, as a folder.\nUndo action name, shown in the Edit menu as Undo Pin Group.\nTitle and button of the sheet that pins the tab group you're in as a folder, with where in the space it goes and its name.",
