    "Show in Finder" : {
      "comment" : "Button at the top of an Office or Apple document shown in a tab, for a file on the Mac.\nButton in the Import window: show the exported passwords file in Finder.\nButton in the toast after Export Your Data: shows the saved files in Finder.\nButton in the toast after Install as App: shows the new app in Finder.\nButton in the toast after Sync with iCloud brought an older library up to date: shows the backup of the older copy in Finder.\nButton on an installed app's row in Settings › General: shows the app itself, selected in its folder in Finder.\nFile menu item of an installed app's window: shows the app itself, selected in its folder in Finder.\nTooltip of a download's button in the downloads panel: shows the file in Finder.",
