    "Tokens: {link}, {encoded_link}, {host}, {path}, {query}, {referrer}, {cookies}, {cookie_header}, {filename}, {mime}, {space}, {file}, {file_url}, {file_raw}. {file}, {file_url} and {file_raw} need File handoff; {file_raw} is the file’s bytes, for a service’s parameters." : {
      "comment" : "The tokens a download rule's fields may use, listed in its sheet. File, file_url and file_raw are only filled in when the rule hands off a saved file; file_raw, the file's contents in base64, only in a JSON-RPC or XML-RPC rule's parameters.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tokens: {link}, {encoded_link}, {host}, {path}, {query}, {referrer}, {cookies}, {cookie_header}, {filename}, {mime}, {space}, {file}, {file_url}, {file_raw}. {file}, {file_url} und {file_raw} erfordern eine Dateiübergabe; {file_raw} ist der Inhalt der Datei, für die Parameter eines Dienstes."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tokens: {link}, {encoded_link}, {host}, {path}, {query}, {referrer}, {cookies}, {cookie_header}, {filename}, {mime}, {space}, {file}, {file_url}, {file_raw}. {file}, {file_url} y {file_raw} necesitan el envío de archivo; {file_raw} es el contenido del archivo, para los parámetros de un servicio."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Jetons : {link}, {encoded_link}, {host}, {path}, {query}, {referrer}, {cookies}, {cookie_header}, {filename}, {mime}, {space}, {file}, {file_url}, {file_raw}. {file}, {file_url} et {file_raw} nécessitent un transfert de fichier. {file_raw} est le contenu du fichier, pour les paramètres d’un service."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Token: {link}, {encoded_link}, {host}, {path}, {query}, {referrer}, {cookies}, {cookie_header}, {filename}, {mime}, {space}, {file}, {file_url}, {file_raw}. {file}, {file_url} e {file_raw} richiedono il trasferimento del file; {file_raw} è il contenuto del file, per i parametri di un servizio."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "使えるトークン：{link}、{encoded_link}、{host}、{path}、{query}、{referrer}、{cookies}、{cookie_header}、{filename}、{mime}、{space}、{file}、{file_url}、{file_raw}。{file}、{file_url}、{file_raw}はファイルを渡すときだけ使えます。{file_raw}はファイルの中身で、サービスのパラメータに使います。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "토큰: {link}, {encoded_link}, {host}, {path}, {query}, {referrer}, {cookies}, {cookie_header}, {filename}, {mime}, {space}, {file}, {file_url}, {file_raw}. {file}, {file_url} 및 {file_raw}은 파일 전달이 필요합니다. {file_raw}은 파일의 내용이며 서비스 매개변수에 사용합니다."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tokens: {link}, {encoded_link}, {host}, {path}, {query}, {referrer}, {cookies}, {cookie_header}, {filename}, {mime}, {space}, {file}, {file_url}, {file_raw}. {file}, {file_url} en {file_raw} vereisen dat een bestand wordt doorgegeven; {file_raw} is de inhoud van het bestand, voor de parameters van een service."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
